# Author list is a placeholder; replace it before publishing.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite it as below."
title: "PEG: a non-invasive incremental visibility channel for graph RAG"
abstract: >-
  Retrieval- and generation-level study of Microsoft GraphRAG v3.3.0 incremental
  indexing on a fixed HotpotQA subset: what the host does on new documents,
  same-title rewrites and deletions, what a paragraph-level visibility channel
  adds, and the operation algebra with its proven properties and cost bound.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PEG contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
keywords:
  - graphrag
  - incremental indexing
  - retrieval evaluation
  - visibility
  - hotpotqa
references:
